  "NewsContent": "<p>The founding president of Aga Khan University, Dr Kassim-Lakha, has been conferred the Sitara-i-Imtiaz by the president of the government of Pakistan. </p><p>The Sitara-i-lmtiaz, one of the country's highest civil awards, recognises his sustained and eminent services in the fields of education and healthcare.<br/></p>",
